            "created_at": "2025-09-07T16:37:31.989353+00:00",
            "notes": "Alright, this round is when you somewhat become a \"tiktok moira\" meaning that you will do more damage, and mostly rely on your other support to heal. However, this does not mean that you shouldn't heal, as your healing can be one of the most powerful in the game if done right. [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is an AMAZING power for this build as it lets us easily get 35% lifesteal. Along with aiming at the head, we can get 65%, long enough to out-tank a [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6). \n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf you decide to go the healing route, I would suggest getting [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) first, then get [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), as your healing is more important to keep your team alive. If you are poor, you can sell [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and get Amari's, along with another good Blue Item.",
